		"description": "<p>A long-ranged form of directed radiation weapon, these guns propel a focused electromagnetic pulse down a narrow channel of ionized air, striking a target at long distances. These weapons were heavily used during the War for destroying mechs and other technological foes, but are far less effective against living creatures.</p><p>The profile for the EMP Beamer can be found in the Military Weapons Table at the start of this section. An EMP Beamer is a powered weapon, which recharges after a Bed rest. Non-robot characters cannot suffer an Injury from an EMP Weapon.</p>",
